desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "golang"
	title: "检测 Go syscall.Exec"
	title_zh: "检测 Go syscall.Exec"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-go-syscall-exec"
	risk: "command-injection"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 syscall.Exec。参数若外部可控可导致命令执行。

### 风险类型
command-injection

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，定位源码中的危险调用或配置。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用固定二进制路径和参数列表。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://e.go": <<<POS
package main
import "syscall"
func r(p string) { syscall.Exec(p, nil, nil) }

POS
	"safefile://s.go": <<<NEG
package main
func r(p string) {}

NEG
)

${*.go}.pattern_regex(/syscall\.Exec\s*\(/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "检测 Go syscall.Exec",
	title_zh: "检测 Go syscall.Exec",
	message: "检测 Go syscall.Exec",
	risk: "command-injection",
}
